WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.400
A holy woman hangs her
wet cloak on a sunbeam,

2
00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:05.010
and it stays there.

3
00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:08.310
She milks a cow three
times in a day for guests,

4
00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:11.420
and turns water into beer for the sick.

5
00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:16.320
This is Brigit of Kildare, as one monk
wrote about her more than a century after

6
00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:17.680
she died.

7
00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:20.770
So if a saint's story is full of miracles,

8
00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:24.320
written so late, is any
of it worth reading?

9
00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:27.830
In this mission, you'll read
the earliest Irish saint's Life,

10
00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:30.360
and a famous Life of Patrick.

11
00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:32.960
Then you'll watch an
Easter fire on a hill,

12
00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:35.560
and a contest with a king's druids.

13
00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:39.810
Your mission: weigh up whether these
miracle stories are worth reading.
